        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Neatly dressed, calm and cooperative, mildly anxious and slightly fidgety when discussing panic. Speech normal in rate and volume. Mood described as “a bit on edge”; anxious, reactive affect. Thought content focused on bodily symptoms and worry about her heart and a pregnancy article; reality testing intact. No delusions or hallucinations. Cognition grossly intact and oriented to person, place, and time. Insight and judgement good."
      }
    },
    {
